&A track record: 1/3 \u2014 no material disclosed M&A; not enough history.\n3. Capex efficiency: 3/3 \u2014 minimal capex, high incremental ROIC.\n4. Rationality of mix: 2/3 \u2014 reinvestment appropriate; no dividend.\n5. Guidance accuracy: 2/3 \u2014 raised FY2026 guidance twice; Q2 beat.\nTotal: 10/15. Insider ownership 4.54% (<5% bonus); no insider transaction data available. [Actual/Aggregator]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSECTION 2.5 \u2014 INTANGIBLES-ADJUSTED FINANCIALS\n\n\u2022 SBC-adjusted FCF FY2025: Reported FCF $0.239B - SBC $0.071B = $0.168B. [Arithmetic]\n\u2022 TTM SBC-adjusted FCF: reported TTM FCF $0.270B - FY2025 SBC proxy $0.071B = ~$0.199B. [Estimate \u2014 TTM SBC not held]\n\u2022 SBC-adjusted FCF margin: FY2025 = 17.7%; TTM = ~19.1%. [Estimate]\n\u2022 Owner earnings estimate (FY2025): NI $0.141B + D&A $0.023B - reported capex $0.003B + working-capital release $0.026B = ~$0.187B. [Estimate]\n\u2022 Operating lease capitalization: operating leases $0.038B treated as debt; included in net-cash calculation. [Filed]\n\u2022 R&D capitalization: not possible \u2014 R&D not broken out in pack; product development embedded in SG&A. [Unconfirmed]\n\u2022 Adjusted ROIC estimate: SBC-adjusted FCF $0.168B / (equity $0.543B + debt $0.038B - cash $0.107B) = ~35.4%. [Estimate]\n\u2022 GAAP ROIC vs adjusted ROIC gap not fully reliable due missing effective tax rate. [Unconfirmed]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u